<title>USA: Investors Title to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>Investors Title to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>CHAPEL HILL, N.C. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors Title Co said its board has authorized the repurchase of up to 150,000 shares of its outstanding common stock from time to time in the open market or in privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The company intends to continue to compensate key employees through stock bonuses and stock options from time to time and wants to avoid dilution to existing shareholders, it said.  </p>
<p>The company has over 2.5 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
